Hand Drawn Style #267 · Kobayashi Manga Minimal Ink Style (original reference: Kobayashi Manga).
Core style features: Chinese-style minimalist hand-drawn comics on a white background; quick sketching with a black brush/soft-tipped pen; loose and rough lines with obvious changes in thickness, slightly broken pens and hand-drawn jitters; highly generalized characters, slightly exaggerated proportions, and clumsy and interesting shapes; only the most necessary objects and actions are retained in the scene; large areas are left blank; black line drawing is the main body; a small amount of red, yellow and green partial flat painting is added to cheeks, clothes or props; the taste of Chinese freehand figure paintings and old-fashioned caricatures;
Usage: Replace "Theme:..." with your theme; the pure image mode generates images directly, and the image and text mode allows text to participate in the composition; the typesetting pattern number and the theme color number can be superimposed.
